This product includes software developed at Takibi (https://takibi.pub).

The adapters in this package were extracted from the Takibi context-enrichment
layer. The upstream product policy layer (queue planning, operator governance,
database access, LLM calls, rate-limit ledgers) is intentionally not included;
callers inject those concerns.

Bundled data files under src/data/:

- context-stat-tables/ecos.json
  Bank of Korea ECOS statistic table index.
  Source: https://ecos.bok.or.kr/api/StatisticTableList
- context-work-names/games.json
  Video game names derived from Wikidata (Q7889 video games, CC0).
  Source: https://query.wikidata.org/
- context-region/districts.json
  Korean administrative district codes and names.
- weather/bot-account.json, weather/regions.json, weather/strings.json
  Weather adapter configuration, region table, and display strings.

Each adapter queries a public API operated by a third party (for example the
National Law Information Center, the National Assembly, the Bank of Korea, the
National Election Commission, the Financial Supervisory Service, or the Korea
Meteorological Administration). Use of those APIs is governed by the respective
operator's terms and by the credentials you supply. This package claims no
rights in the data it fetches.
